# LabOS Workspace — public-fork safety net.
#
# This repository is a PUBLIC, CODE-ONLY fork of https://github.com/toeverything/AFFiNE.
# Its default branch is therefore world-readable, so anything committed here is
# published the moment it is pushed. .gitignore is one layer of protection, not
# proof that a commit is safe — this file catches the second class of mistake:
# real user content, private integration material and machine-specific paths
# that should never have existed in a source tree at all.

# --- Private briefing pack and its derivatives -----------------------------
# The unredacted LabOS briefing (START_HERE / BUILD_PLAN / QA_CHECKLIST /
# REFERENCES) is private handoff material and must never be published.
labos-workspace-brief/
**/labos-workspace-brief/

# --- Real user content and personal workspace material --------------------
# Native AFFiNE workspace stores, exports and recovery packs.
*.affine-backup
affine-backup/
workspace-export/
**/workspaces/affine-cloud/

# --- Private integration material ------------------------------------------
# MeMCP is Jonny's private project; only independently written adapter code may
# live here, never its source, database, generated projections or config.
MeMCP/
.memcp/
**/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
**/PROJECT_TASKS.md
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
memory.sqlite*

